Please replace `"your_data.csv"` with the actual URL of your CSV file. This chart will display the attendance by stadium, colored by league, and sorted in descending order of attendance.

To sort the bars in descending order and show only the top 15 stadiums, we will use a transform to filter the top 15 stadiums after sorting the data.

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "data": {
    "url": "your_data.csv",
    "format": {
      "type": "csv"
    }
  },
  "transform": [
    {
      "window": [{"op": "rank", "as": "rank"}],
      "sort": [{"field": "attendance", "order": "descending"}]
    },
    {"filter": "datum.rank <= 15"}
  ],
  "mark": "bar",
  "encoding": {
    "y": {
      "field": "stadium",
      "type": "nominal",
